      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ran cheets_CTS_T.internal.x86.CtsSensor on pujjogatwin (208 Hz lsm6dsm + lis2dw12) against PS7 caught occasional 2T timestamp gaps when an asynchronous lid accel interrupt triggered back-to-back 3 ms sleeps across a 4.8 ms gyro sample boundary. PS8 moves the minimum-interval sleep after task_wait_event() (measured from ts_end_task), coalesces events that arrive during the sleeep.\n\nStill, CONFIG_MOTION_MIN_SENSE_WAIT_TIME had to be reduced from 3 ms to 2 ms to pass CTS on pujjogatwin and craask.",
